THE NARRATOR

The narrator is a synthetic voice, not a clone of any person's voice. Its identity
recording, assets/audio/narration-reference.wav, was generated from a text description
of a voice with Qwen3-TTS VoiceDesign through mlx-audio and selected by the author. The
English reference and the clear Mandarin reference that the casts name were spoken in
that voice by the Qwen3-TTS Base model, which also narrates both editions.

The pronunciation contract records, as listening targets, English stress from CMUdict at
commit 74790861, Copyright (C) 1993-2015 Carnegie Mellon University, under its
BSD-style license, and Chinese readings from the macOS dictionaries.
